170 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 122 0 R/E(Working in partnership with the City of Santa Clara Solid Waste Creek Clean Up team and the Santa Clara Valley Water District, 14 volunteers cleaned 3 miles of creek corridor, collecting 80 lbs of litter, plastics, and debris before they could wash downstream into the Bay. Keeping our local creeks clean protects local wildlife, improves neighborhood aesthetics, and safeguards our watershed.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[5]>>
